{title: 109 - Marvelous Grace}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #109 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 109}
{meta: category God the Father - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Em/B]Marvelous grace [Am]of [D7/C]our [Em/B]loving Lord,
[D7/A]Grace [Em/B]that exceeds [G/D]our sin and our [D7/C]guilt!
[Em/B]Yonder [G]on [D7/C]Calvary's mount [G/D]outpoured--
[G/D]There [D7/C]where [Em/B]the [D/A]blood [Em/B]of [G]the Lamb was [C/E]spilt.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Refrain}
[C/G]Grace, [G/D]grace, [D7/C]God's grace,
[G/D]Grace [D7/C]that [Em/B]will [C/E]pardon [G/D]and cleanse within
[C/E]Grace, grace, God's [G/D]grace,
[D7/C]Grace that [G/D]is [C/E]greater [D7/C]than [Em/B]all [D/A]our [Em/B]sin!
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Em/B]Sin and despair, [Am]like [G]the [D7/C]sea [D/A]waves [Em/B]cold,
[D7/A]Threaten [Em/B]the [D7/C]soul [G/D]with infinite [D7/C]loss;
[Em/B]Grace [Am]that [G]is [D7/C]greater, yes, grace [G/D]untold
[G/D]Points [D7/C]to [Em/B]the [D/A]Refuge, [G]the mighty [C/E]Cross.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Em/B]Marvelous, infinite, matchless grace,
[D7/A]Freely [Em/B]bestowed [G/D]on all who believe!
[Em/B]You [Am]that [G]are [D7/C]longing to see [G/D]His [C/E]face,
[G/D]Will [D7/C]you [Em/B]this [D/A]moment [G]His grace receive?
{end_of_verse}
